{"title": "Grimlark Verses", "pageid": 40419, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Grimlark_Verses", "categories": ["Grimlark Verses"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>Grimlark Verses</b> refers to series of <a href=\"/wiki/Notes\" title=\"Notes\">Notes</a> by the same name. They appear to be following the alphabet. Below is all of the individual notes and their accompanying text:\n</p>\n<pre>* <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Grimlark_Verse_1\" title=\"Grimlark Verse 1\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6f/Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6f/Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6f/Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6f/Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6f/Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Grimlark_Verse_1\" title=\"Grimlark Verse 1\">Grimlark Verse 1</a></span> <br> A is for Abazigal, blue Bhaalspawn thrown down <br> <br> B is for Bone Throne, Bhaal diced there for a crown\n</pre>\n<pre>* <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Grimlark_Verse_2\" title=\"Grimlark Verse 2\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6f/Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6f/Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6f/Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6f/Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6f/Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Grimlark_Verse_2\" title=\"Grimlark Verse 2\">Grimlark Verse 2</a></span> <br> C is for Cyndre, assasin wizard of Thay <br> <br> D is for Deathstalkers, cultists who slay\n</pre>\n<pre>* <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Grimlark_Verse_3\" title=\"Grimlark Verse 3\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6f/Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6f/Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6f/Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6f/Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6f/Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Grimlark_Verse_3\" title=\"Grimlark Verse 3\">Grimlark Verse 3</a></span> <br> E is for Elkan, by Gromnir betrayed <br> <br> F is First Murder, the Bhaal primate's aide\n</pre>\n<pre>* <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Grimlark_Verse_4\" title=\"Grimlark Verse 4\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6f/Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6f/Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6f/Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6f/Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6f/Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Grimlark_Verse_4\" title=\"Grimlark Verse 4\">Grimlark Verse 4</a></span> <br> G is for Gorion's Ward, foe like no other <br> <br> H is Helena, shapechanger mother\n</pre>\n<pre>* <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Grimlark_Verse_5\" title=\"Grimlark Verse 5\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6f/Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6f/Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6f/Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6f/Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6f/Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Grimlark_Verse_5\" title=\"Grimlark Verse 5\">Grimlark Verse 5</a></span> <br> I is for Illasera, Bhaalspawn fighter-mage <br> <br> J is for Jergal, exhaused by age\n</pre>\n<pre>* <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Grimlark_Verse_6\" title=\"Grimlark Verse 6\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6f/Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6f/Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6f/Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6f/Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6f/Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Grimlark_Verse_6\" title=\"Grimlark Verse 6\">Grimlark Verse 6</a></span> <br> K is for Keen Strike, Bhaal's order great <br> <br> L is for Liia, Duke Jannath of the Gate\n</pre>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715161914\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.042 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.046 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2239/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 16590/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3384/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 19/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.030/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 965247/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   39.068      1 -total\n 99.54%   38.889      6 Template:MdRarityItem\n 75.60%   29.534      6 Template:Item_icon\n 25.01%    9.772     12 Template:ItemIcon_Internal\n 14.68%    5.734     12 Template:Ifempty\n 13.79%    5.386 